# Build context for infra/docker/*.Dockerfile. The Dockerfiles copy named paths
# only; this file is the second line, for what sits untracked *inside* those
# paths on a teammate's machine. The runner builds from a clean checkout, but
# `docker compose --profile app build` on a laptop sends the working tree.
#
# Mirrors the data and scratch entries of .gitignore: anything git refuses
# because of its size, licence or owner must not reach an image layer either.
# AI Hub corpora may not be shared even inside the team (#517 review).

# Version control, tooling, agent scratch
.git
.github
.githooks
.claude
.codex*
.superpowers
.logs
docs
Claude outputs
_to_delete
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/*.diff
**/*.patch

# Build output and caches
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Audio, models, local data and corpora (docs/architecture/privacy.md)
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.m4a
**/*.flac
**/models
**/.cache
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/data
**/dataset
**/datasets
**/corpus
**/runs
modules/intelligence/scripts/mock_payloads.py
modules/intelligence/scripts/mock_payloads
